[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3365812863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111165#issuecomment-3365812863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111165","id":3365812863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Injp_","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T14:05:14Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T14:07:31Z","body":"I was thinking about such an early return, but I had some suspicion of it breaking something when the method is used in some `parented` callback, where the parent/child data is already set, but the tree isn't yet.\r\n\r\nIf such a state can occur `tree` might be `nullptr` for the node that is currently in the process of being added, but `tree` would be the actual pointer for the other node.\r\n\r\nTo avoid regressions in such edge cases I opted to just use the old behaviour in such cases.\r\nA save early return might be `data.tree != nullptr && p_node->data.tree != nullptr && data.tree != p_node->data.tree`. But I don't even know if a scenario with two scene trees is something we fully support, and its probably so rare that it didn't feel worth it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3365812863/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4879517036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111165#issuecomment-4879517036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111165","id":4879517036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIteFbA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T21:51:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T21:51:10Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4879517036/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_gith